+## Session initialization failures
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the caller rejects with that same error after `onError(session, error)` and then `afterSession(session)` have completed; both hooks receive the original session, and no user-input or model-response work runs, so cleanup must tolerate initialization that never completed and release only resources actually acquired ([validated by: reports a beforeSession failure and runs cleanup before rejecting with the original error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L7)).
